# RUN: llc -mtriple=haydn-unknown-elf -global-isel-abort=1 \
# RUN:   -run-pass=early-machinelicm -verify-machineinstrs %s -o - \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s

# Role: MIR — (Path B) — 2-dest SIMD MAC must not abort in MachineLICM::calcRegisterCost.

# REGRESSION TEST: (Path B) — 2-dest SIMD MAC must not abort in
# MachineLICM::calcRegisterCost.
#
# Bug: The D_RRA2 _FLEX format classes (HaydnFormatsMAC.td) declare 6 bits
# fields (rtd1, rtd2, rsd1, rsd2, rta1, rta2) but the 1-dest collapse left
# rtd2/rta1/rta2 orphaned (declared as fields, bound to no dag operand).
# CodeGenFormat derived NumOperands=6 from the bits-field set while the
# selector emitted only 4 operands -> MachineLICM::calcRegisterCost
# (MachineLICM.cpp:958) iterated 0..6 calling MI.getOperand(i) -> OOB assert
# (ArrayRef::operator Index < Length) at i=4. This aborted 9+ NatureDSP
# family-A kernels (vec_stddev16x16, vec_shift16x16,...).
#
# Fix (Path B): bind ALL 6 fields to dag operands (2 defs + 4 ins with
# tied-def Constraints) so NumOperands matches the actual MI operand count.
# The selector's selectSimdMacAcc2Dest emits the 2-def shape.
#
# Test design: a hand-written MIR with X4MULA16S_S1 (2 defs + 4 uses
# tied accumulators). -run-pass=early-machinelicm walks calcRegisterCost over
# all operands. Before the fix this aborts (exit 134); after the fix it runs
# clean and CHECKs the instruction survives. Straight-line code is sufficient
# the OOB is in per-MI operand iteration, independent of loop structure.

---
name:            test_x4mula16s_flex_machinelicm
selected:        true
tracksRegLiveness: true
registers:
  - { id: 0, class: dr64 }
  - { id: 1, class: dr64 }
  - { id: 2, class: dr64 }
  - { id: 3, class: dr64 }
  - { id: 4, class: dr64 }
  - { id: 5, class: dr64 }
body:             |
  bb.0:
    %0 = IMPLICIT_DEF
    %1 = IMPLICIT_DEF
    %2 = IMPLICIT_DEF
    %3 = IMPLICIT_DEF

    ; X4MULA16S_S1 is the family-A crashing op: 2 defs (rtd1, rtd2) tied
    ; to 2 accumulator inputs (rta1, rta2), plus 2 sources (rsd1, rsd2). Before
    ; the desc said 6 operands but only 4 were present -> OOB. Now 6 = 6.
    %4, %5 = X4MULA16S %0, %1, %2, %3
    $d0 = COPY %4
    $d1 = COPY %5
    RET implicit $d0, implicit $d1, implicit $r0, implicit $r15
...

# CHECK-LABEL: name: test_x4mula16s_flex_machinelicm
# CHECK: X4MULA16S
# CHECK-NOT: Assertion
